  "notes": "Built with Microsoft Fluent UI v9 (Segoe UI, #0f6cbd brand, 4px radii, #d1d1d1 strokes). Symmetric bidirectional converter: left panel Clash YAML -> right panel links, with full-width arrow buttons 'To Node Link →' / '← To Clash Config' pointing at the other panel. Header has a subtle drop shadow and only two icon buttons (language toggle switches EN/ZH directly, no menu; theme toggle). Each panel has outlined secondary 'Paste' and filled primary 'Copy' buttons top-right, and subtle 12px transparent toolbar buttons (Open File, Load URL, Download) — Load URL expands an inline URL field + fetch button rather than a modal. Textareas are fixed-height scroll panels. Grey f5f5f5 engine card with a status dot and switch."
